  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pg83/solo/zipball/9",
  "body": "The static demo: a musl-linked executable that loads the host's unmodified glibc Vulkan stack and renders an image with it. Download, `chmod +x`, run: `./vulkan-x86_64 out.png` (needs any Vulkan driver, e.g. mesa-vulkan-drivers).\n\n## What's Changed\n* Search the calling image's RUNPATH for dlopen from loaded code by @Nikita-prog-art in https://github.com/pg83/solo/pull/4\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Nikita-prog-art made their first contribution in https://github.com/pg83/solo/pull/4\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pg83/solo/compare/8...9",
  "mentions_count": 1
